          width="1200" 
          height="800" 
          loading="lazy" 
        />
      </div>
      
<p>India offers cost and scalability advantages, but export-oriented brands must ensure international compliance readiness. Manufacturing location does not override destination country regulations.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Lower manufacturing costs in India</li>
  <li>Export compliance requirements</li>
  <li>Documentation and transport readiness</li>
</ul>
</section>

<!-- IS CONTRACT AEROSOL FILLING RIGHT FOR YOUR BUSINESS? -->
<section class="section" id="is-contract-aerosol-filling-right-for-your-business">
  <h2>Is Contract Aerosol Filling Right for Your Business?</h2>
  <p>Contract filling is ideal for brands prioritizing speed, safety, and capital efficiency. As volumes increase, in-house manufacturing may become commercially viable.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Startups and early-stage brands</li>
  <li>Specialized or seasonal aerosol products</li>
  <li>Export-focused product lines</li>
</ul>
</section>

